[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7922.47, "timestamp": "02:12:02", "text": "一樣。讓它盯上你。啊。  哦。  它在哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7930.55, "timestamp": "02:12:10", "text": "呃，西部。  啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7932.31, "timestamp": "02:12:12", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7935.669, "timestamp": "02:12:15", "text": "看到了嗎？你看到了嗎？  它在哪裡？什麼鬼？  它在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7936.79, "timestamp": "02:12:16", "text": "哪裡？  這到底是哪裡？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7947.83, "timestamp": "02:12:27", "text": "火箭。哦，在那邊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7950.95, "timestamp": "02:12:30", "text": "好吧，我只有18發子彈了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7951.83, "timestamp": "02:12:31", "text": "快點。好吧，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7955.109, "timestamp": "02:12:35", "text": "也許是這棟大樓。  好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7958.31, "timestamp": "02:12:38", "text": "，我先引誘它。我的天，好險！呃，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7960.719, "timestamp": "02:12:40", "text": "等等， 等等。我們能飛到高處去拍攝嗎？  我打算先上到屋頂上去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7964.239, "timestamp": "02:12:44", "text": "等等。我們能飛到高處去拍攝嗎？  我打算先上到屋頂上去 。屋頂上好像有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7966.0, "timestamp": "02:12:46", "text": "。屋頂上好像有 個窗戶之類的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7967.36, "timestamp": "02:12:47", "text": "個窗戶之類的 ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7968.48, "timestamp": "02:12:48", "text": "？ 呃，就是這棟大樓。  天哪，我的腳踝又骨折了。  告密者"}]